    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        257,
        2835,
        1806,
        2971
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "3. The appropriate City staff agencies shall render advice to The Director of Labor Relations on questions of law, finance, personnel policy, operations and management.",
